# Catalog of applications 


All images are on the [images](https://github.com/abcdesktopio/images/tree/main/artifact/{{ abcdesktop.latest_release }}) repository [https://github.com/abcdesktopio/images/tree/main/artifact/{{ abcdesktop.latest_release }}](https://github.com/abcdesktopio/images/tree/main/artifact/{{ abcdesktop.latest_release }})

For each application you will find the `Dockerfile` to rebuild the container image and the `json` file to install it using the `console` adminstration or the command line script.

There is more than {application_count} applications all ready packaged as a container image. 

